        <mxCell id="n1" value="Refresh errors are logged (warn) and the workspace keeps its data; nothing is emitted when 0 sources changed. Opening more files while on requires set_live(true) again so the new roots are watched. UI toggle is in progress (backend command exists)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
